+
+    /// A component Pumpkin cannot encode comes back as `NbtTag::End`. Writing it as a
+    /// named child or list element produced NBT that vanilla misparses
+    /// ("fieldSize is too long! Length is 28009"), so it must be left out.
+    #[test]
